HOW THIS SOFTWARE WAS MADE
==========================

SENTINEL-F was developed by DGKN@Labs with the help of AI coding assistants
(including Claude Code by Anthropic). The idea, requirements, architecture,
review, testing and parts of the source code are the work of DGKN@Labs; other
parts were generated with AI assistance under DGKN@Labs' direction and then
reviewed, tested and integrated by DGKN@Labs. The development history is
kept private; each public release is published as a single commit.


INTENDED USE
============

SENTINEL-F is built for security testers, forensic analysts, incident
responders and education. Use it only on files and systems you are
authorised to examine. Heuristic scores are indicators, not proof; verify
critical findings manually. This section is a statement of purpose, not an
additional license restriction.


